  m_text: "EMITTER          releases one visible pulse.\nREFLECTOR      turns the
    pulse in 45\xB0 steps.\nABSORBER        stops a pulse.\nSPLITTER          forks
    one pulse into two.\nDELAY PLATE   holds a pulse a set number of beats.\nRECEIVER        
    needs a pulse.  Forbidden ones must stay silent.\nRESONATOR      needs two pulses
    in the right relationship."
